                translation: LocalizedText(en: "When Joseph said to his father, “O my father, I saw eleven stars, and the sun and the moon - I saw them prostrating to me.”", ur: "When Joseph said to his father, “O my father, I saw eleven stars, and the sun and the moon - I saw them prostrating to me.”", ar: ""),
