                arabic: "فَلَمَّا ذَهَبُوا۟ بِهِۦ وَأَجْمَعُوٓا۟ أَن يَجْعَلُوهُ فِى غَيَٰبَتِ ٱلْجُبِّ ۚ وَأَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَيْهِ لَتُنَبِّئَنَّهُم بِأَمْرِهِمْ هَٰذَا وَهُمْ لَا يَشْعُرُونَ",
                translation: LocalizedText(en: "So when they took him away and agreed to cast him into the bottom of the well… We revealed to him, “You will surely tell them of this deed of theirs, when they do not perceive who you are.”", ur: "So when they took him away and agreed to cast him into the bottom of the well… We revealed to him, “You will surely tell them of this deed of theirs, when they do not perceive who you are.”", ar: ""),
                reference: "Yusuf · 12 : 15",
                reflection: LocalizedText(en: "At the very bottom - betrayed, alone, a child in the dark - the first voice he hears is God's. Not rescue, but a promise: one day you will stand before them, and they will not know you. Imam Ali said God is nearest to His servant in the hardest hour. The well was not the end of the dream. It was the first step into it.", ur: "At the very bottom - betrayed, alone, a child in the dark - the first voice he hears is God's. Not rescue, but a promise: one day you will stand before them, and they will not know you. Imam Ali said God is nearest to His servant in the hardest hour. The well was not the end of the dream. It was the first step into it.", ar: "At the very bottom - betrayed, alone, a child in the dark - the first voice he hears is God's. Not rescue, but a promise: one day you will stand before them, and they will not know you. Imam Ali said God is nearest to His servant in the hardest hour. The well was not the end of the dream. It was the first step into it.")
