                arabic: "قَالَ رَبِّ ٱلسِّجْنُ أَحَبُّ إِلَىَّ مِمَّا يَدْعُونَنِىٓ إِلَيْهِ ۖ وَإِلَّا تَصْرِفْ عَنِّى كَيْدَهُنَّ أَصْبُ إِلَيْهِنَّ وَأَكُن مِّنَ ٱلْجَٰهِلِينَ",
                translation: LocalizedText(en: "He said, “My Lord, prison is dearer to me than that to which they call me. And if You do not turn their scheming away from me, I may incline to them and be of the ignorant.”", ur: "He said, “My Lord, prison is dearer to me than that to which they call me. And if You do not turn their scheming away from me, I may incline to them and be of the ignorant.”", ar: ""),
