                reflection: LocalizedText(en: "A prophet who will not pretend he is safe from himself. He does not say “I am too pure to fall.” He says: keep me from it, or I might. Imam al-Baqir said the angels marveled that he chose the darkness of a prison over the darkness of sin. Strength is not never being tempted. It is knowing which darkness to fear.", ur: "A prophet who will not pretend he is safe from himself. He does not say “I am too pure to fall.” He says: keep me from it, or I might. Imam al-Baqir said the angels marveled that he chose the darkness of a prison over the darkness of sin. Strength is not never being tempted. It is knowing which darkness to fear.", ar: "A prophet who will not pretend he is safe from himself. He does not say “I am too pure to fall.” He says: keep me from it, or I might. Imam al-Baqir said the angels marveled that he chose the darkness of a prison over the darkness of sin. Strength is not never being tempted. It is knowing which darkness to fear.")
