            .act(
                act: 3, connector: LocalizedText(en: "You have seen him tested, kept pure, and raised at last to the throne.", ur: "You have seen him tested, kept pure, and raised at last to the throne.", ar: "You have seen him tested, kept pure, and raised at last to the throne."), line: LocalizedText(en: "Now the famine he foretold drives them back to Egypt: the brothers who sold him, standing before him for bread, not knowing the minister is the boy from the well. And an old father, still waiting, still refusing to despair.", ur: "Now the famine he foretold drives them back to Egypt: the brothers who sold him, standing before him for bread, not knowing the minister is the boy from the well. And an old father, still waiting, still refusing to despair.", ar: "Now the famine he foretold drives them back to Egypt: the brothers who sold him, standing before him for bread, not knowing the minister is the boy from the well. And an old father, still waiting, still refusing to despair."),
