                    translation: LocalizedText(en: "“…and do not despair of God's relief. Indeed, no one despairs of God's relief except the disbelieving people.”", ur: "“…and do not despair of God's relief. Indeed, no one despairs of God's relief except the disbelieving people.”", ar: ""),
