                reflection: LocalizedText(en: "He holds all the power now, and every right to revenge. Instead: no blame today. Not “I will try, in time, to forgive” - the door is thrown open the very moment it can be. And even his forgiveness he hands upward: may God forgive you. Mercy, at the exact instant it costs the most.", ur: "He holds all the power now, and every right to revenge. Instead: no blame today. Not “I will try, in time, to forgive” - the door is thrown open the very moment it can be. And even his forgiveness he hands upward: may God forgive you. Mercy, at the exact instant it costs the most.", ar: "He holds all the power now, and every right to revenge. Instead: no blame today. Not “I will try, in time, to forgive” - the door is thrown open the very moment it can be. And even his forgiveness he hands upward: may God forgive you. Mercy, at the exact instant it costs the most.")
